KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
SAT - SAT Math (Year 2023)

Q1. A line in the xy-plane passes through (2, 5) and (6, 13). What is the slope of this line?
  (A) 1
  (B) 2
  (C) 3
  (D) 4
  Answer: B - Slope m = (13 - 5) / (6 - 2) = 8 / 4 = 2.


